WEBVTT

27:31.801 --> 27:33.511
you can't get any worse.

27:34.971 --> 27:37.349
(BOTH CHUCKLING)

27:43.688 --> 27:46.441
I hear you're reading a boring book.

27:46.566 --> 27:48.276
Hmph.

27:48.401 --> 27:52.072
- Pycelle talks too much.
- Oh, he never stops.

27:52.197 --> 27:54.532
Do you know Ser Hugh of the Vale?

27:55.533 --> 27:57.118
Not surprising.

27:57.244 --> 28:01.748
Until recently, he was only
a squire - Jon Arryn's squire.
